product json schema
-------------------
{
  "product_id": "string",
  "product_name": "string",
  "category": "string",
  "subcategory": "string",
  "brand": "string",
  "description": "string",
  "price": "float",
  "discount_percentage": "int",
  "final_price": "float",
  "average_rating": "float",
  "review_count": "int",
  "stock_quantity": "int",
  "in_stock": "bool",
  "color": "string",
  "size": "string",
  "view_count": "int",
  "purchase_count": "int",
  "wishlist_count": "int",
  "is_prime_eligible": "bool"
}

-----------------------------
Upload sing product data API
-----------------------------
curl --location 'http://localhost:8080/api/kafka/publish' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "productId": "P12345",
    "productName": "Wireless Headphones",
    "category": "Electronics",
    "subcategory": "Audio",
    "brand": "SoundMagic",
    "description": "High quality wireless headphones with noise cancellation.",
    "price": 199.99,
    "discountPercentage": 10,
    "finalPrice": 179.99,
    "averageRating": 4.5,
    "reviewCount": 124,
    "stockQuantity": 50,
    "inStock": true,
    "color": "Black",
    "size": "Standard",
    "viewCount": 500,
    "purchaseCount": 150,
    "wishlistCount": 75,
    "isPrimeEligible": true
}'
---------------
Bulk Upload API
---------------
curl --location --request POST 'http://localhost:8080/api/kafka/publish/batch/local?filePath=%2FUsers%2Fpurusottammohapatra%2FDocuments%2Fwork%2Fdata-injection-with-kafka%2Fproducts_1M_enhanced.csv'
